<title>POLAND: BANK SLASKI STARTS CONSULTING FIRM.</title>
<headline>BANK SLASKI STARTS CONSULTING FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Slaski SA formed a subsidiary consulting firm, BSK Konsulting Sp. zoo with a start-up capital of 150,000 zlotys, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BSK Konsulting will give financial advice, organise and manage companies as well as research markets, Bank Slaski said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
